# Inventory sync & revalidation (blueprint §7)

- Implement `POST /api/revalidate` secured with `REVALIDATE_SECRET` (header or query — pick one and document in the route).
- On success, call `revalidateTag` / `revalidatePath` for the affected product and/or global catalog.
- WooCommerce webhooks (Product updated, Order created) POST to this route; treat payloads as untrusted except for the shared secret.
- Never expose `REVALIDATE_SECRET` to the client.
